libc++ (LLVM 18) <sstream>: basic_ostringstream's constructors and
destructor converted with no dropped body after
cpp_constructor_overload_resolution_with_virtual_base (they were dropped:
`basic_ostream<_CharT, _Traits>(&__sb_)' "did not uniquely resolve", and the
destructor passed the internal @most_derived flag against a real
parameter).  o.good() is checked since ios_base::init and locale's
constructor (defined in libc++.so) are modelled
(cpp17_libcxx_ostringstream_state).  clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++ accepts this
program.
